// ============================================================================
//  StockRestore.restockwhitelist
//  Re-enables the STOCK art assets that Restock disables (blacklists) for the
//  parts we are restoring in StockRestore.cfg.
//
//  Each line is a GameData-relative path. A trailing "/" matches every file in
//  that folder. Restock loads any file that is whitelisted even if it is also
//  blacklisted, so these stock .mu/.dds assets load again.
//
//  Only parts whose stock assets Restock actually blacklists are listed here.
//  Making History parts (Wolfhound, Mastodon, the S4 Kerbodyne tanks) and the
//  HECS2 are NOT on Restock's blacklist, so they need no whitelist line -- the
//  RestockIgnore flag alone restores them.
// ============================================================================


